      "Replication": "Disabled",
      "Description": "Un paramètre de fonction, utiliser avec des noeuds personnalisés.\r\n\r\nVous pouvez spécifier le type et la valeur par défaut du paramètre. Par exemple,\r\n\r\nentrée: var[]..[]\r\nvaleur: bool = false"
    },
    {
      "ConcreteType": "PythonNodeModels.PythonNode, PythonNodeModels",
      "Code": "# Copyright(c) 2026\r\n# Durmus Bayryam\r\n\r\nimport sys\r\nimport numpy as np\r\n    \r\ndef decode_onehot(encoded_data, encoder):\r\n    try:\r\n        X = np.array(encoded_data)\r\n    except Exception as e:\r\n        return [f\"Data Error: {str(e)}\"]\r\n\r\n    if X.ndim == 1:\r\n        X = X.reshape(-1, 1)\r\n        \r\n    # Inverse Transform \r\n    try:\r\n        original_matrix = encoder.inverse_transform(X)\r\n        return original_matrix.flatten().tolist()\r\n        \r\n    except Exception as e:\r\n        return [f\"Decoder Error: {str(e)}\"]\r\n\r\n# OUTPUT\r\nif 'IN' in locals():\r\n    data_to_decode = IN[0]\r\n    encoder_object = IN[1]\r\n    OUT = decode_onehot(data_to_decode, encoder_object)",
      "Engine": "CPython3",
      "VariableInputPorts": true,
      "Id": "548fabe885d94831a2488d748895dfbb",
      "NodeType": "PythonScriptNode",
